---
const credentials = [
  'Founder, Alder Consulting',
  '30+ years in brand strategy',
  'Policy & business adviser',
  'Author',
];
---

<section class="dark bg-[var(--dark)] text-[var(--on-dark)] py-16 md:py-24" id="facilitator">
  <div class="wrap t-grid grid grid-cols-1 min-[861px]:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] gap-9 min-[861px]:gap-16 items-center">
    <img
      src="img/leke-portrait.jpg"
      alt="Portrait of Leke Alder in a grey check suit, arms folded"
      class="rounded-lg w-full max-w-[420px] aspect-[4/5] object-cover object-top mx-auto min-[861px]:mx-0"
    />
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow text-[var(--red-on-dark)]">The Facilitator</p>
      <h2 class="text-[clamp(1.9rem,4vw,3rem)] font-[var(--head)] font-semibold leading-[1.12] tracking-[-0.02em] my-[14px] mb-6 text-white">
        Leke Alder
      </h2>
      <p class="text-[var(--dark-muted)] max-w-[58ch] mb-4 leading-relaxed">
        <strong class="text-[var(--on-dark)] font-semibold">Lawyer by training. Strategist by calling.</strong> Leke Alder is the Founder and Principal of Alder Consulting, the creative intelligence firm he has built over more than three decades.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[var(--dark-muted)] max-w-[58ch] mb-4 leading-relaxed">
        He is credited with introducing branding as a discipline to Nigeria, and has advised on policy, politics and business at the highest levels at home and abroad. Origins distils that experience into a working method you can apply to your own idea.
      </p>
      <div class="creds flex flex-wrap gap-[10px] mt-7">
        {credentials.map((cred) => (
          <span class="text-[0.85rem] px-[14px] py-2 border border-[var(--dark-line)] rounded-full text-[var(--on-dark)]">
            {cred}
          </span>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
